{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "pm.credential.transfer_remove.contracts.schema.v1",
  "title": "Bounded typed owner companion for SIR-024 credential attachment transfer preview/apply and credential source remove",
  "description": "Static technical companion for exactly cmd.credential_attachment.transfer.preview, cmd.credential_attachment.transfer.apply and cmd.credential_source.remove (SIR-024; TOUCH-SGAPCMD-036/037/040). It preserves the existing IntegrationCredential family authority, permission, error, availability and disabled-reason grammars and binds only the six adjudicated specification-gap facets: typed request/preview/result/error operands, exact destination Host/Environment and owner/topology generations, owner-selected requested scope, portability/reauthentication and secret-exclusion evidence, content/currentness binding of a read-only preview, current human approval plus idempotency for apply, separately admitted encrypted-envelope evidence where and only where the credential adapter and protected owner independently prove portability and authorization, and explicit source-remove ownership/dependency/active-work/data-disposition evidence. References only; no secret bytes, raw credential, ciphertext or protected authentication content is expressible. No new portability mode, source-removal policy, disposition enum, secret transport or product meaning is created; effect states reuse the existing family effect_state vocabulary and lease resolution reuses the existing LeaseCoordinator terminal-disposition vocabulary. Disposition evidence remains owner-issued and native-unproved.",
  "x-schema-id": "pm.credential.transfer_remove.contracts.v1",
  "x-owner": "Plans/Shared_Integration_Runtime.md#SIR-024",
  "x-command-count": 3,
